                        <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><i class="fa-solid fa-box text-[#FF3B30]"></i> Version 4.0</span>
                        <span>•</span>
                        <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><i class="fa-solid fa-file-arrow-down text-emerald-500"></i> Size: 68.2 MB</span>
                        <span>•</span>
                        <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><i class="fa-solid fa-android text-emerald-500"></i> Android 5.0+</span>
                        <span>•</span>
                        <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-emerald-600 font-bold"><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-check"></i> VirusFree</span>
                    </div>
                </div>

