                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#1E2229] mb-3">Lightning Fast Speed</h3>
                    <p class="text-[#68707E] text-sm leading-relaxed">Multi-thread download technology accelerates downloading speeds up to 5x faster than standard browsers.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100 hover:shadow-md transition group">
                    <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl hero-gradient text-white flex items-center justify-center text-2xl mb-6 shadow-md group-hover:scale-110 transition">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-music"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#1E2229] mb-3">4K & MP3 Converter</h3>
