                    <div class="absolute -top-4 left-8 w-10 h-10 rounded-full hero-gradient text-white font-extrabold flex items-center justify-center shadow-md">3</div>
                    <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#1E2229] mt-4 mb-2">Enjoy Unlimited Downloads</h3>
